" ==========================================================
" vimrc  ->  ~/.vimrc
" Managed by ubu-setup. Edit the template in the repo, not the symlink target.
"
" Merged from the two files that were live on the source box:
"   ~/.vimrc       -> termguicolors + synthwave
"   ~/.vimrc-orig  -> defaults.vim, mouse/clipboard/paste handling
" Every option that is not universally available is feature-guarded so this
" file loads clean on a stock Vim or a headless box.
" ==========================================================

" Load Ubuntu/Debian's stock sensible defaults first — this is what a fresh
" install without a ~/.vimrc gets, and it's what enables clean bracketed paste
" (right-click / Ctrl+Shift+V paste with no auto-indent staircase).
runtime! defaults.vim

" --- our overrides, applied AFTER the defaults ---

" defaults.vim turns on 'mouse=a', which makes vim grab the mouse and hijacks
" the terminal's right-click "Paste". Give the mouse back to the terminal.
set mouse=

" Use the X11 clipboard, which is the one VirtualBox's VBoxClient --clipboard
" bridges to the host. (GNOME Wayland's native clipboard is NOT bridged.)
" 'clipmethod' is new in Vim 9.1.1443; older builds pick x11 on their own.
if exists('+clipmethod')
  set clipmethod=x11
endif

" Make ordinary y/p use the system clipboard (the + register) automatically.
" Only meaningful in a build with +clipboard; without it this errors.
if has('clipboard')
  set clipboard=unnamedplus
endif

" Safety fallback: F2 toggles paste mode if any terminal ever misbehaves.
" 'pastetoggle' is deprecated in recent Vim and gone in Neovim (which relies on
" bracketed paste instead), so only set it where it still exists.
if exists('+pastetoggle')
  set pastetoggle=<F2>
endif

" --- colors ---
" 24-bit color. Requires a truecolor terminal; the Konsole "Synthwave" profile
" installed by ubu-setup is one. Guarded so a 16-color tty still gets the
" cterm fallbacks baked into the colorscheme.
if has('termguicolors') && ($COLORTERM ==# 'truecolor' || $COLORTERM ==# '24bit')
  set termguicolors
endif

syntax on

" Never let a missing colorscheme abort the rest of the vimrc.
silent! colorscheme synthwave
